{'symbol': 'CARR', 'date': '2022-01-05 13:00:00', 'title': 'AUTOMATED LOGIC ACQUIRES INTEGRATED CONTROL SYSTEMS INC', 'text': 'KENNESAW, GA., JAN. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AUTOMATED LOGIC CONTRACTING SERVICES INC (AUTOMATED LOGIC), A LEADING PROVIDER OF INNOVATIVE BUILDING-MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS, HAS ACQUIRED THE BUSINESS OF INTEGRATED CONTROL SYSTEMS INC (ICSI), AN INDEPENDENT AUTOMATED LOGIC CONTROLS CONTRACTOR WITH OFFICES IN ARIZONA, COLORADO AND NEW MEXICO.'}